      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "GOOSEBUMPS RICO (1) has been beaten for early speed lately, last time finishing seventh (24.32) in a Grade 5 at this track. Solid record here winning 11 races. The form from his last run is stacking up nicely. Has ability and is a key runner. PRICKLE (8) turned in a better effort at this track last start, finishing third behind Paw Lester (24.55) in a Grade 5. Settled off speed and worked to the line nicely. Winning chance. IVORY PANKE (7) was below best at her last start when 8th at this track following a win (24.21) there two back. Form here at the trip sound including two wins. Will give the top chances plenty to think about. ULTIMO (4) can measure up with the right run.",
